WHY THIS IS NOT OPENLY LICENSED
-------------------------------
The source code (MIT, see ../LICENSE) and the simulation datasets
(CC BY 4.0, see ../LICENSE-DATA) are openly licensed so that the results in this
work can be independently reproduced. That is deliberate and unaffected by this
notice.

The manuscript itself is reserved. Open licences such as CC BY are irrevocable
once granted, and granting one over the manuscript now could conflict with a
publisher's copyright agreement later. Keeping the paper All Rights Reserved
preserves the authors' freedom to publish it wherever they choose.

WHAT YOU MAY DO
---------------
The manuscript is made available here for reading, review and verification of
the results against the openly licensed code and data. You may read it, cite it,
and quote from it as permitted by fair dealing / fair use and normal academic
citation practice.

You may NOT redistribute, republish, mirror, translate or create derivative
works from the manuscript without the authors' written permission.

STATUS
------
This manuscript is unpublished and under review. It is a preprint: it has not
completed peer review, and its content may change before publication. Upon
acceptance, this notice will be replaced by the publisher's required copyright
statement, and the accepted version will carry the publisher's notice and DOI.

